# DeepSelect MUSA source distribution contents.
#
# The prebuilt wheel is the supported distribution form (see WHEEL-TAG-SPEC);
# this sdist is kept buildable for MUSA source installs once the submodule
# content is materialized. CUTLASS is only needed by the CUDA backend and is
# therefore pruned.
include LICENSE
include README.md
include CHANGELOG.md

include csrc/musa_kernels/*.mu
graft csrc/3rdparty/mutlass/include
graft csrc/3rdparty/mutlass/LICENSE*
include csrc/3rdparty/mutlass/README.md

# setup.py imports tests.kernelkit at build time.
graft tests/kernelkit
include tests/__init__.py

prune csrc/3rdparty/cutlass
prune csrc/cuda_kernels
prune csrc/ascend_kernels
prune assets
prune benchmarks
prune docs
